CDDA 0.I: safe runtime efficiency for low-memory browsers.
Apply after activity-perf. Supersedes F-20's unsafe 16-turn danger-check
throttle. Synthetic benchmark timings are NOT real-game performance proof.
AI and danger checks retain upstream order and frequency. Yielding improves
browser responsiveness, not the amount of AI work. Progress text is lazy;
its upstream turn-based display cadence is unchanged.

